issue(id="0023" status="review")
  title Upgrade pinned workflow tooling
  user-story
    as-a Repository maintainer
    i-want Current stable mise and Renovate workflow tooling.
    so-that CI and release automation receive upstream improvements.
  premise.
    GitHub Actions remain pinned to full commit SHAs, and mise remains pinned to
    an explicit release. This maintenance change does not affect published packages.
  acceptance-criteria
    criterion The mise action uses v5.1.1 and installs mise 2026.10.6.
    criterion The Renovate action uses v46.3.7.
    criterion Workflow validation introduces no diagnostics relative to main.
  review-items
    item(status="covered") Upstream release tags resolve to the pinned action commits.
    item(status="covered") Actionlint reports no diagnostics before or after the upgrades.
